        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569040/extras/131553d1e11ad8f62ac347fae1160c50.avif?t=1762524931\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569040/extras_big/131553d1e11ad8f62ac347fae1160c50.avif?t=1762524931 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grind Momo</strong> is an incremental <strong>clicker game</strong> where you earn money, invest strategically, and build a business empire through clicking and smart decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💼 <strong>Work &amp; Earn</strong> – Choose a job based on your level and <strong>click</strong> to generate income.<br>💰 <strong>Invest Wisely</strong> – Grow your wealth by trading <strong>stocks, crypto, and funds</strong>.<br>🏠 <strong>Real Estate &amp; Rentals</strong> – <strong>Buy properties</strong> and <strong>vehicles</strong> to rent out for steady income.<br>🏭 <strong>Craft or Buy</strong> – Use <strong>factories</strong> to craft items at a lower cost, or purchase items from the market to rent or sell for profit.<br>📦 <strong>Manage Inventory</strong> – View your owned items in your inventory for tracking and management.<br>🎯 <strong>Milestones</strong> – Achieve milestones across various values, unlocking <strong>bonuses</strong> related to that type of milestone (e.g., money, XP, etc.).<br>🔄 <strong>Prestige System</strong> – Reset your progress to earn <strong>prestige points</strong> that can be spent on <strong>upgrades</strong> such as <strong>combo gain</strong>, <strong>delays</strong>, or boosting <strong>XP</strong> and <strong>money</strong> per click.<br>⚙️ <strong>Config Options</strong> – Customize your experience with the ability to</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the <strong>color theme</strong> of the entire game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access <strong>cheat options</strong> to adjust certain game aspects (hidden).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grind, invest, and level up with strategic upgrades, milestones, and customization!</strong><br>🚀 Built with Flutter on Android Studio.</p>",
